  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Common Bitch**: back after 82 archived shows (787 days) [5]\n- **Never Squeal on th' Pusher**: rare: 5 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween2004-10-17** (recommended): source not stated; 32 songs; 161 min; rated 3/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer finds the recording good but not the best, rating it four out of five [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer understands Gener entered rehab right afterward, which caused the second tour leg's cancellation; he reportedly partied hard down the west coast [2]\n- The encore ran about seventeen minutes, and the reviewer enjoyed it [3]\n- Reviewer met Gener outside the venue before the show, then watched from the rail [4]\n- While fist-pumping at the rail, reviewer was grabbed and accidentally punched a woman in the face [4]\n- Reviewer remembers the show as long and hot [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Ween2004-10-17**: Recorded with Core-Sound Stealth cardioid mics into a Sony D-8 DAT, then Magix Audio Studio 6, CDR, EAC and FLAC [1]",
